whisper.cpp and ggml
https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp, commit 482279b8a18855ba741d7b88c30fcb3874691f59
(git submodule third_party/whisper.cpp; compiled into the libczechspeech_*.so native libraries)

Also adapted from whisper.cpp examples/whisper.android (same licence): the JNI glue structure in
native/src/czechspeech_jni.c and the big-core thread count in CpuThreads.kt. The GPT-2 graph of variant selection in
native/src/czechspeech_lm.c follows ggml's examples/gpt-2 (https://github.com/ggml-org/ggml, same licence and
authors). whisper.cpp is compiled with native/patches/whisper.cpp-czechspeech.patch applied (beam search fix, every
beam's hypothesis).
